.git
.gitignore
.venv
venv
node_modules
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
src/nightwire/static/*
# `**/` matters: a bare `__pycache__` pattern matches only the top level, so
# nested bytecode was being copied into the image. It shadowed nothing (the
# installed package is what runs) but it shipped stale compiled copies of
# source that had since changed.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.env
config
recordings
design/*.png
